# basePath Chapter1

:: FirstContractOpen
@trigger    OnContractSelectOpen
@cutscene
@once
{@Player}      You only have one contract to choose from.
$call   HighlightElement(overarching:costs-section)
{@Player}      It looks like it will take this many days to complete.
$call   ReleaseAllHighlights()
$call   HighlightElement(overarching:profit-section)
{@Player}      ...and you'll make this much money if you can deliver.
$call   ReleaseAllHighlights()
$call   HighlightElement(overarching:select-contract-btn)